1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,885
The decision was taken in a flat above a retail unit, and it answered a simple question: how do we let a building fall into use without selling the land?

2
00:00:09,885 --> 00:00:16,805
“The role of the council is to occupy the ground and to halt the sale,” the advocate said.

3
00:00:16,805 --> 00:00:22,239
“A cheque and a poster will not rescue a public service.”

4
00:00:22,239 --> 00:00:28,489
The understanding in the room was that the danger was ordinary and the emergency was not.

5
00:00:28,489 --> 00:00:36,943
“We have a warning and we have a fire escape; what we do not have is a necessity,” the narrator of the meeting said.

6
00:00:36,943 --> 00:00:44,212
“A tale about tradition is not a plan, and a guess is not a production figure.”

7
00:00:44,212 --> 00:00:49,022
The sharp part of the discussion was the refusal of the retailer.

8
00:00:49,022 --> 00:00:54,577
“We can forgive a delay and we cannot forgive a betrayal,” Maya wrote.

9
00:00:54,577 --> 00:01:04,666
“The innocence of a small shop does not endanger the water supply, and the urgency of the bank does not liberate the council.”

10
00:01:04,666 --> 00:01:16,965
The advocate for the tenants proposed a concerted scheme: a strip of shops on a lease, a flat for the caretaker, and an equivalence between the old rate and the new one.

11
00:01:16,965 --> 00:01:24,265
“A reformist measure is worth more than a supposition about the future,” she said.

12
00:01:24,265 --> 00:01:28,974
The vote was seven to five, and the effect was immediate.

13
00:01:28,974 --> 00:01:36,109
“We do not immunize a city against scarcity by depressing its rates,” the treasurer said.

14
00:01:36,109 --> 00:01:46,578
“We build a habit of paying.” The council would occupy the building within the year, and the sale would halt at the end of the term.

15
00:01:46,578 --> 00:01:53,082
The real issue had been between two ways of holding power: to own or to steward.

16
00:01:53,082 --> 00:02:03,156
The activity of the council, its drive to build, and the support of the tenants had produced a decision that neither side could call a victory.

17
00:02:03,156 --> 00:02:11,366
Someone had to weave the two plans together, and only then would the order of the day become an act instead of a lie.

18
00:02:11,366 --> 00:02:22,869
The advocacy of the tenants was a promise not to betray them, and the building would not sell itself, and the only thing left was the vote.
